{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-10","name":"プロデューサー","text":"（寝ちゃってるのか……）","trans":"（睡着了吗……）","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"プロデューサー","text":"愛依、最近は特に頑張ってくれてたもんな……","trans":"爱依，最近特别努力啊……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"プロデューサー","text":"風邪ひかないように\r\nブランケットを──","trans":"为了不感冒\n把毛毯──","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-17","name":"プロデューサー","text":"っと！","trans":"呃！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901043190040","name":"愛依","text":"アハハ～、成功成功～♪","trans":"啊哈哈～，成功成功～♪","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"プロデューサー","text":"寝たふりだったのか……\r\nまんまと騙されたな","trans":"原来是装睡啊……\n完全被骗到了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901043190050","name":"愛依","text":"ちょーいいリアクションだったよ～！","trans":"反应超好的～！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}